          "quote": "医院里一天做三次，是因为孩子当时还在发炎、有肺实变、可能还有喘"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "HO2 is triggered by the grandmother's belief that 'hospital did more' (seen in event lite_evt_00123). The doctor explicitly corrects this misconception in plain language, linking it to a concrete action (stop nebulization until a verified plan is made). This is a complete and meaningful correction.",
